A black and white logo centered on a white background.

At the top of the logo is a circular graphic element composed of eight stylized leaves arranged in a sunburst pattern, pointing outward from a central empty circle. Each leaf is identical, featuring a thick black outline in a teardrop shape. Inside each leaf is a vertical line (a midrib) with two shorter diagonal lines branching off towards the sides, forming an upward-pointing arrow-like pattern within the leaf shape.

Centered directly below the graphic element are two lines of text:

1. The first line reads "live wild" in a lowercase, informal, and thick-stroked handwritten font.
2. The second line, centered below the first, reads "TRAVEL HOKKAIDO" in all uppercase letters. This line uses a clean, thin, geometric sans-serif font with wide spacing between each letter. The second line of text is wider than the first line.